(7278451, 1133429, 25190, '<td valign="top">You good sharpness with this image but i feel the foreground takes up too much of the photo i would of had the castle?.. more off center and have the the mountain work with it more</td>', 'You good sharpness with this image but i feel the foreground takes up too much of the photo i would of had the castle?.. more off center and have the the mountain work with it more', '2014-10-30 21:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278552, 1133620, 156466, '<td valign="top">For all that color, though, it really lacks "pop" - it really lacks highlights.</td>', 'For all that color, though, it really lacks "pop" - it really lacks highlights.', '2014-10-31 08:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278652, 1133337, 118154, '<td valign="top">I like the way this is and hope others do too.</td>', 'I like the way this is and hope others do too.', '2014-10-31 13:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278654, 1133449, 118154, '<td valign="top">Certainly has a lovely feel to it. The white light bit is a little stranger than not but no worries.</td>', 'Certainly has a lovely feel to it. The white light bit is a little stranger than not but no worries.', '2014-10-31 13:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278669, 1133632, 140305, '<td valign="top">Certainly are new! Cute photo.</td>', 'Certainly are new! Cute photo.', '2014-10-31 13:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278687, 1133632, 11738, '<td valign="top">Interesting image treatment</td>', 'Interesting image treatment', '2014-10-31 15:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278766, 1133620, 29011, '<td valign="top">Splendid. Though it tests ones patience, always fun shooting bubbles.</td>', 'Splendid. Though it tests ones patience, always fun shooting bubbles.', '2014-10-31 21:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278837, 1133474, 18505, '<td valign="top"><strike></strike></td>', '', '2014-11-01 12:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278876, 1133478, 30490, '<td valign="top">Does this need to be straightened a bit or is it just my eyes?  Otherwise the composition is nice.  I like the red trim, it gives some life to the building.</td>', 'Does this need to be straightened a bit or is it just my eyes?  Otherwise the composition is nice.  I like the red trim, it gives some life to the building.', '2014-11-01 16:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278877, 1133474, 30490, '<td valign="top">Awww, that is a new baby!</td>', 'Awww, that is a new baby!', '2014-11-01 16:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278879, 1133584, 30490, '<td valign="top">Wow, your oven is much cleaner than mine!!  Great idea and image!</td>', 'Wow, your oven is much cleaner than mine!!  Great idea and image!', '2014-11-01 16:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278965, 1133478, 13077, '<td valign="top">It''s an attractive view with a lot of cool elements to it, but the crookedness hurts it in my opinion.</td>', 'It''s an attractive view with a lot of cool elements to it, but the crookedness hurts it in my opinion.', '2014-11-01 22:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278966, 1133620, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and patterns here - makes me wonder what that is.</td>', 'Interesting colors and patterns here - makes me wonder what that is.', '2014-11-01 22:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278968, 1133465, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The cloud edges and the eclipse have created a very interesting scene.</td>', 'Nicely done. The cloud edges and the eclipse have created a very interesting scene.', '2014-11-01 22:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278970, 1133538, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this. Everything that''s going on in this scene is interesting, and you''ve exposed and processed it well.</td>', 'I like this. Everything that''s going on in this scene is interesting, and you''ve exposed and processed it well.', '2014-11-01 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278971, 1133625, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - fisheyes are fun. Good use of it, too - this scene is well suited and becomes more interesting shot this way.</td>', 'Nice - fisheyes are fun. Good use of it, too - this scene is well suited and becomes more interesting shot this way.', '2014-11-01 22:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278972, 1133616, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice gallery, good luck with sales.</td>', 'Looks like a nice gallery, good luck with sales.', '2014-11-01 22:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278973, 1133584, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yum!<br/>If you''ve got an oven with this clear of a window, maybe a time lapse video of some bread dough rising and then baking would be really cool.</td>', 'Yum!If you''ve got an oven with this clear of a window, maybe a time lapse video of some bread dough rising and then baking would be really cool.', '2014-11-01 22:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278974, 1133359, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic view,  and the clouds look really cool.</td>', 'Nice scenic view,  and the clouds look really cool.', '2014-11-01 22:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278975, 1133280, 13077, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.</td>', 'Pretty cool.', '2014-11-01 22:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278976, 1133522, 13077, '<td valign="top">Shot from a drone? Looks like a really nice place.</td>', 'Shot from a drone? Looks like a really nice place.', '2014-11-01 22:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278978, 1133619, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good composition and ominously dark sky contrasted with the light on the building, but the way the panels have the dripping stuff or streaks is a bit distracting. Not your doing though, I''m sure...</td>', 'Good composition and ominously dark sky contrasted with the light on the building, but the way the panels have the dripping stuff or streaks is a bit distracting. Not your doing though, I''m sure...', '2014-11-01 22:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278979, 1133607, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the light/shadows. Why is part of the light fixture sharp but the rest blurry?</td>', 'I like the composition and the light/shadows. Why is part of the light fixture sharp but the rest blurry?', '2014-11-01 22:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278980, 1133575, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent blend of sharpness and blur here, and very well composed.</td>', 'Excellent blend of sharpness and blur here, and very well composed.', '2014-11-01 22:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278981, 1133617, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the processing style of this one.</td>', 'I like the processing style of this one.', '2014-11-01 22:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278982, 1133650, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and good light, really pops off the screen well.</td>', 'Very sharp and good light, really pops off the screen well.', '2014-11-01 22:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278983, 1133477, 13077, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this one.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this one.', '2014-11-01 22:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278984, 1133590, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - excellent light and exposure, and well composed.</td>', 'Nice - excellent light and exposure, and well composed.', '2014-11-01 22:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278985, 1133413, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice atmosphere to this one. I like how it seems to capture the feeling of the dragonfly resting on the hillside, surveying his domain.</td>', 'Nice atmosphere to this one. I like how it seems to capture the feeling of the dragonfly resting on the hillside, surveying his domain.', '2014-11-01 22:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278986, 1133563, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cool - I like how you''ve included some humans in contrast to all the monsters here.</td>', 'Cool - I like how you''ve included some humans in contrast to all the monsters here.', '2014-11-01 22:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278987, 1133629, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating face on that one.</td>', 'Fascinating face on that one.', '2014-11-01 22:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278988, 1133593, 13077, '<td valign="top">I''m so curious as to what those strings are for.<br/>Very well composed and exposed photo too.</td>', 'I''m so curious as to what those strings are for.Very well composed and exposed photo too.', '2014-11-01 22:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278989, 1133338, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - I like the blend of shapes and colors here, it''s very attractive.</td>', 'Nice - I like the blend of shapes and colors here, it''s very attractive.', '2014-11-01 22:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278990, 1133611, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - excellent light and perfectly exposed. I like the composition as well.</td>', 'Nice - excellent light and perfectly exposed. I like the composition as well.', '2014-11-01 22:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278991, 1133643, 13077, '<td valign="top">It turned out pretty well in my opinion. I like all the negative space, suits the concept well.</td>', 'It turned out pretty well in my opinion. I like all the negative space, suits the concept well.', '2014-11-01 22:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278992, 1133213, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice moment you''ve captured here, but I think the edge blur is a little strong for my taste. Color tones and composition are very good though, and that''s a super cool dog - my neighbors have a female one that always managed to get out and comes over to tease our dogs when they''re inside the fence.</td>', 'Nice moment you''ve captured here, but I think the edge blur is a little strong for my taste. Color tones and composition are very good though, and that''s a super cool dog - my neighbors have a female one that always managed to get out and comes over to tease our dogs when they''re inside the fence.', '2014-11-01 22:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278993, 1133241, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The amount of detail you''ve caught in the galaxy is great, but the stars are just starting to look blurred - I''m guessing about 1 minute exposure on a ~24mm equivalent lens? I really like how you''ve got what looks like clouds in the water in the foreground.<br/>I love night photography, but I''m not very good at it yet, plan to experiment more every time there''s a clear sky around the new moon time though.</td>', 'Very nice. The amount of detail you''ve caught in the galaxy is great, but the stars are just starting to look blurred - I''m guessing about 1 minute exposure on a ~24mm equivalent lens? I really like how you''ve got what looks like clouds in the water in the foreground.I love night photography, but I''m not very good at it yet, plan to experiment more every time there''s a clear sky around the new moon time though.', '2014-11-01 22:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278994, 1133648, 13077, '<td valign="top">Well done - the seed pods really pop out at the viewer with this one. I like the composition and the color tones too.</td>', 'Well done - the seed pods really pop out at the viewer with this one. I like the composition and the color tones too.', '2014-11-01 22:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278995, 1133201, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is super cool.</td>', 'This is super cool.', '2014-11-01 22:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278996, 1133091, 13077, '<td valign="top">lol - that''s my favorite way of eating most things as well, sometimes I feel not-so-classy but I get over it.<br/>The slight blur is appropriate for the concept, and the expression on her face suits it well too.</td>', 'lol - that''s my favorite way of eating most things as well, sometimes I feel not-so-classy but I get over it.The slight blur is appropriate for the concept, and the expression on her face suits it well too.', '2014-11-01 22:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278997, 1133474, 13077, '<td valign="top">Now now, just because she''s been generating stinky diapers at a frightful pace doesn''t mean she needs to sleep out in the yard!<br/>lol</td>', 'Now now, just because she''s been generating stinky diapers at a frightful pace doesn''t mean she needs to sleep out in the yard!lol', '2014-11-01 22:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278998, 1133649, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating take on this scene. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Fascinating take on this scene. I like it a lot.', '2014-11-01 22:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7278999, 1133621, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice - well captured and good light. I wonder if it might have looked better from an even lower, closer angle and looking up?</td>', 'Nice - well captured and good light. I wonder if it might have looked better from an even lower, closer angle and looking up?', '2014-11-01 22:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279000, 1133623, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good detail captured in the eyes, but I think a little more contrast in the near-highlights would have helped. In fact, I would have gone with a darker processing overall, since there''s a good deal of noise in the background when presented as high-key as this.</td>', 'Good detail captured in the eyes, but I think a little more contrast in the near-highlights would have helped. In fact, I would have gone with a darker processing overall, since there''s a good deal of noise in the background when presented as high-key as this.', '2014-11-01 22:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279002, 1133646, 13077, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that B&amp;W was the best choice for this one - the milkweed pod sort of blends in with the lighter part of the background, at the top half of the frame.</td>', 'I don''t know that B&W was the best choice for this one - the milkweed pod sort of blends in with the lighter part of the background, at the top half of the frame.', '2014-11-01 22:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279003, 1133533, 13077, '<td valign="top">Looks like Magneto from the X-Men''s dream flea market table!</td>', 'Looks like Magneto from the X-Men''s dream flea market table!', '2014-11-01 22:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279004, 1133458, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. I like the little bit of motion you''ve shown in the people going down the escalator, and the tones and little bit of grain are impeccable. One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Excellent composition. I like the little bit of motion you''ve shown in the people going down the escalator, and the tones and little bit of grain are impeccable. One of my favorites so far.', '2014-11-01 22:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279005, 1133449, 13077, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light and clouds here - I love how you''ve captured the blur in the moving clouds.</td>', 'Wonderful light and clouds here - I love how you''ve captured the blur in the moving clouds.', '2014-11-01 22:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279006, 1133532, 13077, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to see the bird. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Took me a moment to see the bird. I like this a lot.', '2014-11-01 22:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279007, 1133608, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this - it has a timeless, free vibe to it.</td>', 'I like this - it has a timeless, free vibe to it.', '2014-11-01 22:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279008, 1133179, 13077, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition of shapes and patterns here. I like it; sometimes a photo comes together and becomes much more than the sum of its parts.</td>', 'Interesting composition of shapes and patterns here. I like it; sometimes a photo comes together and becomes much more than the sum of its parts.', '2014-11-01 22:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279009, 1133628, 13077, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle of view here. I can''t decide if the edge blur was added in post-processing, or the result of a wide-angle filter in front of the lens of a phone or point-and-shoot camera.<br/>Doesn''t really matter - fascinating photo, well done.</td>', 'Excellent angle of view here. I can''t decide if the edge blur was added in post-processing, or the result of a wide-angle filter in front of the lens of a phone or point-and-shoot camera.Doesn''t really matter - fascinating photo, well done.', '2014-11-01 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279011, 1133574, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2014-11-01 22:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279013, 1133589, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the almost-surreal atmosphere of this one. Everything looks fairly ordinary, but somehow the way it''s all presented there''s a sense of unease and nonsense.</td>', 'I like the almost-surreal atmosphere of this one. Everything looks fairly ordinary, but somehow the way it''s all presented there''s a sense of unease and nonsense.', '2014-11-01 23:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279014, 1133219, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice angle of view and I like the processing treatment here.</td>', 'Nice angle of view and I like the processing treatment here.', '2014-11-01 23:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279017, 1133644, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating composition of the wooden structure in contrast to the trees. I like all the shapes and shadows.</td>', 'Fascinating composition of the wooden structure in contrast to the trees. I like all the shapes and shadows.', '2014-11-01 23:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279020, 1133633, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words. I like the gritty textures - looks like a fascinating place, and ironic for a challenge called something "new". <br/>Perfect exposure too, and well cropped.</td>', 'Nice play on words. I like the gritty textures - looks like a fascinating place, and ironic for a challenge called something "new". Perfect exposure too, and well cropped.', '2014-11-01 23:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279021, 1133423, 13077, '<td valign="top">They''ve sure gone to a lot of effort. Not a bad photo, sharpness-wise for what''s obviously a very low light scene, but I think the composition could probably have been improved somehow to make the most of the scene.</td>', 'They''ve sure gone to a lot of effort. Not a bad photo, sharpness-wise for what''s obviously a very low light scene, but I think the composition could probably have been improved somehow to make the most of the scene.', '2014-11-01 23:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279022, 1133571, 13077, '<td valign="top">No kidding! Awesome catch, I''ve never seen them fly let alone been able to photograph one.</td>', 'No kidding! Awesome catch, I''ve never seen them fly let alone been able to photograph one.', '2014-11-01 23:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279023, 1133429, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. I''m not crazy about the blue/cyan color cast in the shadows, though.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. I''m not crazy about the blue/cyan color cast in the shadows, though.', '2014-11-01 23:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279024, 1133632, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cute duckies!<br/>Not sure I like the old-fashioned low contrast B&amp;W treatment for this particular scene, but maybe you meant it in contrast to the new ducklings?</td>', 'Cute duckies!Not sure I like the old-fashioned low contrast B&W treatment for this particular scene, but maybe you meant it in contrast to the new ducklings?', '2014-11-01 23:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279025, 1133046, 13077, '<td valign="top">Doggone it... I''m thankful I don''t know the song too well or it definitely would have been stuck in my head.</td>', 'Doggone it... I''m thankful I don''t know the song too well or it definitely would have been stuck in my head.', '2014-11-01 23:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279026, 1133526, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured moment. Leaves a lot of this story untold, but it''s intriguing and makes me wonder what happens next.</td>', 'Nicely captured moment. Leaves a lot of this story untold, but it''s intriguing and makes me wonder what happens next.', '2014-11-01 23:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279027, 1133599, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and exposed here.</td>', 'Nicely composed and exposed here.', '2014-11-01 23:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279028, 1133097, 13077, '<td valign="top">I never could figure out how they sculpt things out of sand. Oh well.</td>', 'I never could figure out how they sculpt things out of sand. Oh well.', '2014-11-01 23:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279029, 1133261, 13077, '<td valign="top">Hey, beats a frown.</td>', 'Hey, beats a frown.', '2014-11-01 23:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279030, 1133170, 13077, '<td valign="top">I get the feeling this was quite out-of-focus and that''s why you''ve given it this processing treatment?<br/>I don''t quite get the title, either.</td>', 'I get the feeling this was quite out-of-focus and that''s why you''ve given it this processing treatment?I don''t quite get the title, either.', '2014-11-01 23:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279031, 1133130, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and interesting ''expression'' he seems to have on his face.</td>', 'Nicely composed, and interesting ''expression'' he seems to have on his face.', '2014-11-01 23:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279032, 1133193, 13077, '<td valign="top">I don''t find anything compelling or interesting about this, photography wise.</td>', 'I don''t find anything compelling or interesting about this, photography wise.', '2014-11-01 23:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279033, 1133534, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating arrangement of colorful shells here.</td>', 'Fascinating arrangement of colorful shells here.', '2014-11-01 23:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279034, 1133337, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice looking squirrel.</td>', 'Nice looking squirrel.', '2014-11-01 23:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279035, 1133618, 13077, '<td valign="top">This is funny somehow. I think if I was running in this I would get so distracted by the guy with the burning hair.</td>', 'This is funny somehow. I think if I was running in this I would get so distracted by the guy with the burning hair.', '2014-11-01 23:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279036, 1133597, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very cool architecture there. Perfectly exposed here, and excellent composition.</td>', 'Very cool architecture there. Perfectly exposed here, and excellent composition.', '2014-11-01 23:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279038, 1133608, 136989, '<td valign="top">I would love to go walk in a creek on my Sunday afternoon.  (Must do homework instead.) Fun picture with a neat perspective.  My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I would love to go walk in a creek on my Sunday afternoon.  (Must do homework instead.) Fun picture with a neat perspective.  My favorite in this challenge.', '2014-11-01 23:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
