(7279578, 1133179, 16148, '<td valign="top">If I had voted in the challenge you might have gotten to 5.5.  Not that matters at all.  It''s a beautiful photograph. The tight crop on the truck creates a nice foreground layer.  I don''t necessarily dislike the heavy vignette but I''d be interested in seeing the natural image.</td>', 'If I had voted in the challenge you might have gotten to 5.5.  Not that matters at all.  It''s a beautiful photograph. The tight crop on the truck creates a nice foreground layer.  I don''t necessarily dislike the heavy vignette but I''d be interested in seeing the natural image.', '2014-11-03 11:06:33.000000', NULL, 0),
