(7279673, 1133241, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by flaherma:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow, amazing for your first attempt! You''ll have to travel over to Haleakala and get more of these.  Congrats on the ribbon Mark :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is definitely on my list of things to do in the near future. Haven''t been to Maui in about 10 yrs so would be nice to go over.<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for the comments! :)</td>', 'Originally posted by flaherma: Wow, amazing for your first attempt! You''ll have to travel over to Haleakala and get more of these.  Congrats on the ribbon Mark :)   This is definitely on my list of things to do in the near future. Haven''t been to Maui in about 10 yrs so would be nice to go over. Thanks everyone for the comments! :)', '2014-11-03 16:13:21.000000', NULL, 0),
